# NorthStar Urban Mobility coursework, root .gitignore.
# This file is the single source of truth for what should never enter
# the repo. Subfolder .gitignore files repeat the most relevant rules
# so the project still behaves if a folder is copied out on its own.

# ---- Secrets ----------------------------------------------------------
# The Atlas connection string is stored locally in mongodb/.env. That
# file MUST never be committed. mongodb/.env.example is the safe stub
# the marker fills in.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ---- Raw dataset ------------------------------------------------------
# The 9 NorthStar CSVs live in northstar_dataset/ at the repo root.
# They are committed so the Colab notebooks can read them by raw URL
# without the marker having to upload anything.

# ---- Generated artefacts ---------------------------------------------
# SQLite database written by sql_r/load_northstar.R.
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal

# Charts produced by R analytics and Python processing.
r_analytics/charts/
python_processing/charts/

# Cleaned tables produced by python_processing/etl.py.
python_processing/cleaned/

# RDS caches produced by R analytics.
r_analytics/*.rds

# ---- Language toolchain clutter --------------------------------------
# Python.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/

# R.
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history
.RData
.Ruserdata
.Rproj.user/

# ---- OS and editor clutter -------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# ---- Course-supplied PDFs (not ours to redistribute) -----------------
# The case study and assignment briefs are UWL teaching material.
# They live in the workspace folder for reference only, never on GitHub.
Case Study*.pdf
Databases and Analytics Assignment*.pdf
NorthStar Assignment Guide.docx

# ---- Skill scratch folder --------------------------------------------
assessment-wrap-up-skill/
